<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>2D 游戏引擎：增强物理系统</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            background: #0f1219;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
        }
        .container {
            background: #1a1f2b;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 28px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
        }
        canvas {
            display: block;
            width: 900px;
            height: 640px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            background: #141a26;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
            cursor: crosshair;
        }
        .toolbar {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 16px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }
        .btn-group {
            display: flex